  "category": "portfolio",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "description": "A bold, editorial design for design studios, agencies, photographers and freelancers: warm grey paper, black type, electric blue and acid lime, oversized Space Grotesk headlines and a scrolling ticker of disciplines. Includes a project portfolio with case-study pages (gallery, client, year, what we did, outcomes), filters by discipline and industry, a project-brief form, numbered services, clients and team.",
